  "description": {
    "en": "Yonex REXIS Speed is the most response- and speed-oriented member of the REXIS multifilament family. Its nylon and polyester multifilament construction works with FORTIMO™ polyurethane, FRF (Fusion of Resin Filament) processing and molecular-level Plasma Bonding to improve repulsion, elasticity and durability. Yonex positions REXIS Speed for players of all swing speeds who want a highly responsive, lively string with added ball speed. On the official Comfort & Playability map, it sits significantly more toward the responsive and firm side than REXIS Feel or Comfort.",

    "zh": "Yonex REXIS Speed 是 REXIS 多芯系列中最强调 Response、Power 与 Ball Speed 的型号。它采用 Nylon + Polyester Multifilament 复合结构，并结合 FORTIMO™ 聚氨酯、FRF（Fusion of Resin Filament）制造工艺以及分子级 Plasma Bonding 技术，以提升回弹、弹性和耐久。Yonex 将它定位为适合所有挥拍速度、追求 Highly Responsive 和 Added Speed 的球员。根据官方 Comfort & Playability 图，REXIS Speed 明显比 REXIS Feel 和 REXIS Comfort 更靠近 Responsive 与 Firm 区域，因此整体击球感更加直接、活跃、快速，而不是单纯追求最柔软的线床。"
  },

